ov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-baby-sleep-pillows-psa8","verified":"OPSS reports links between these products and child fatalities in the UK and overseas.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"BABY_SLEEP_06","direct_score_input":false},{"row":77,"status":"PASS_BABY_SLEEP_07","source":"OPSS baby-sleep-pillow safety","url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-baby-sleep-pillows-psa8","verified":"Businesses must place only safe products on the market and remove unsafe products from sale.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"BABY_SLEEP_07","direct_score_input":false},{"row":78,"status":"PASS_BABY_SLEEP_08","source":"OPSS baby-sleep-pillow safety","url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-baby-sleep-pillows-psa8","verified":"The alert distinguishes baby sleep pillows from breastfeeding-only nursing pillows and compliant mattresses.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"BABY_SLEEP_08","direct_score_input":false},{"row":79,"status":"PASS_WITH_BABY_SLEEP_09","source":"OPSS baby-sleep-pillow safety","url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/child-safety-baby-sleep-products","verified":"Baby-sleep-product risk depends on product design, softness, ventilation, intended age, use, supervision, sleep environment and compliance.","quality_score":"3","adoption":"BABY_SLEEP_GUARD_09","direct_score_input":false},{"row":80,"status":"PASS_WITH_BABY_SLEEP_10","source":"OPSS baby-sleep-pillow safety","url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-baby-sleep-pillows-psa8","verified":"OPSS baby-sleep evidence is product-, child-, use-, environment-, compliance- and time-specific and is not an exact parcel-level fatality probability.","quality_score":"3","adoption":"BABY_SLEEP_GUARD_10","direct_score_input":false}]}